\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  and can move around for about 30 minutes a day. She finds chatbots invaluable for identifying symptom patterns and exploring treatment options, though she doesn\u8217 t make major changes without consulting a doctor.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 But while chatbots are trained in part on the best evidence about ME/CFS, they are also trained on pseudoscientific ideas that spread among desperate patients, she noted, and on popular misconceptions.}{\rtlch\afs24
\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2
\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Ms. Holcomb was alarmed when ChatGPT suggested \u8220 regular exercise,\u8221  because exercise intolerance is a hallmark of ME/CFS, and even mild activity can worsen symptoms. But, she added, some doctors make the same recommendation.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Samantha Allen Wright, 36, an English professor in Oskaloosa, Iowa, has used ChatGPT to look for information about managing migraines and a type of dysautonomia called POTS. She said she had been struck by its uneven performance.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 ChatGPT has been more helpful than any provider she has seen, she said, in suggesting dietary changes for POTS that consider her preferences, frequent nausea and migraines.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard
\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 At the same time, \u8220 it often interprets lab results wrong by overanalyzing minor discrepancies,\u8221  she said. For instance, it latched onto a triglyceride number that her doctor assured her was fine. And when she had gastrointestinal symptoms after starting a new medication, it falsely assured her they were common, citing a study.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 When Ms. Wright asked ChatGPT for the study, it admitted there wasn\u8217 t one. Her doctor said her experience wasn\u8217 t normal and took her off the medication.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0
\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Like Ms. Gamwell, Ms. Wright has relevant expertise. She isn\u8217 t a medical professional, but her research focuses on illness and disability. She knows how to critically review evidence.}
